::MODULE{FIELDS|title:Stored facts}
title brand price currency original_price offer_url source_url valid_until fetched_at

::RULE{only:Use a price when the official source exposes an explicit current price and a higher comparison price for the same product}
::RULE{missing:If a price or comparison price cannot be verified, omit the offer; never estimate}
::RULE{expiry:If valid_until is exposed and has passed, do not present the offer as current}
::BOUNDARY{never:Invent prices, discounts, coupons, expiry dates, affiliate IDs, or commissions|scope:permanent}
::BOUNDARY{crawl:Public pages only; honor robots.txt; no login, CAPTCHA, APIs, blocked paths, or anti-bot bypass|scope:permanent}

